    "summary": "Bamboo tobacco pipe with nodes at top and bottom. Circular perforation in bottom and small circular perforation at top, threaded with twisted plant fibre cord. Further circular perforation at top third. Decorated with serrated incised lines; bottom half divided into rectangles by three horizontal lines and one vertical; short lines face into each rectangle. Top half divided into opposing triangles on one side and diamond on other with two vertical lines between, each with short lines extending from either side; line around top with short lines extending from top and bottom.",
